      {
        "text": "Street Warriors Online sounded like an excellent idea having pick a class and fight in the streets or any arena without any use of guns. However despite how good the game is fighting with fists and kicks the game that I actually we're actually bots. It only felt like this game was meant to be a single-player game rather than a multiplayer game. \n\nHaving multiple bots in racing games is okay because it was the norm for old racing game titles but having bots in group street fights in the game just felt empty and not fun at all.\n\nI would recommend playing the game if you're looking to do achievement hunting but not recommend playing this game because of the bots. \n\nStreet Warriors needed to step up to their game by either making a DLC single-player campaign mode just like how Halo Reach does ",
